# Content packs (All-In-One)

Uni+ Learning Tools reads **only** `content-packs/` through content-api. A pack appears when this file exists:

`content-packs/<pack-folder>/manifest.json`

Do **not** nest packs in `S3/` or any year folder. Do **not** add teaching files under `public/`, `dist/`, `js/`, or `index.html` (old hub).

## Folder shape (one topic-list topic = one pack)

```
content-packs/bb02-molecules-of-life/
  manifest.json
  tools/<slug>/index.html
  tools/shared/
```

S3 packs are `bb01-introduction-to-biology` through `bb06-personal-health-and-diseases`. Add later topics as `sb03-…` when their files exist. Do not create an empty pack except BB01 (listed so All-In-One shows the topic; quizzes land when files exist).

## Shared BB02 and SB01 topics

Blue rows (BB02 2.1–2.7 and SB01 1.1) are one topic. Green rows (BB02 2.8 and SB01 1.2) are one topic. Keep one file. Tag a quiz about either group with both `BB02` and `SB01`. The groups are `sharedGroups` in `content/topics/bio-topics.json`.

## New item inside a topic

Add labs, comics, and quiz pages under `tools/<slug>/` with `index.html`, and list them in `tools`. Set `"section": "comics"` or `"section": "quizzes"` when the page is not a lab. Tag titles with a syllabus **Symbol** from `content/topics/bio-topics.json`. Do not invent Symbols.

Shell files (embed, draw tool, flashcard session, membrane quiz helpers) stay in `bb02-molecules-of-life/tools/shared`. Other packs load them as `../shared/…`. Do not copy that folder into every pack.

## Quizzes

Quiz pages are HTML under `tools/<slug>/index.html` with `"section": "quizzes"`. Keep old question ids. Leave quiz runners, `postMessage`, and tracking unchanged.

## Stop

Duplicate `scope`, a second copy of a shared BB02/SB01 file, year-folder wrappers, or quiz runner / tracking changes → ask the technical owner. Do not push.
